<h2 id="h2_content_1_2" class="heading-after-first">基本情報  <a class="anchor_super" name ="info"></a> <a class="anchor_super" href="/arcaea/::cmd/edit?page=FrontPage&id=info" rel='nofollow'><span class="system-icon paraedit" title="Edit"></span></a></h2>
